- Hey Sal, good to be here to be here.

00:01:26.036 --> 00:01:27.576
- So, for those of y'all who don't know,

00:01:27.576 --> 00:01:30.236
Kristen is Khan Academy's
Chief Learning Officer

00:01:30.236 --> 00:01:33.396
